{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06631","headline":"新丰作贻殷四校书 · 储光羲","name":"新丰作贻殷四校书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉皇思旧邑，秦地作新丰。\n南出华阳路，西分长乐宫。\n安知天地久，不与昔年同。\n鸡犬暮声合，城池秋霁空。\n纷吾从此去，望极咸阳中。\n不见芸香阁，徒思文雅雄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06631.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06631","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}